{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "03cc285868a5cd06a2c7e7a6ef36b3e310ec821e7c5d554dca2d9e9398290033", "ja": "（『EScape』のメンバーで音楽番組に出演する\nため、ローカル局のスタジオにやってきたが……）", "zh": "（『EScape』的成员来到地方电视台的摄影棚，\n参加音乐节目演出……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1738a9924ec1ddac0d942c77e50bd30d889dfebb307649972eca7cf6759b6d06", "ja": "瑞希、なんだか難しい顔をしてるみたいだけど……\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "瑞希，我看你好像面有难色……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "46335a7fa6879cd847afc29abe72f6fe85e4578c7664ac1fd114d407383565c8", "ja": "{$P$}。\nはい、少し考えごとをしていました。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n是的，我在想一点事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1003_p", "source_sha256": "69173cda62f0ebd413223fd535f4a385b9a98bce5712f9c6bc262f793dca8fd4", "ja": "考え事って……。", "zh": "想事情……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "9f6f74cfbe69de6b85a26338b86c6d671518a674e493d2a596c1bbf65d31acba", "ja": "はい。この前教えてもらった、\n私達EScapeの魅力についてです。", "zh": "嗯，是关于你之前所说的，\n我们『EScape』的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "60304e1a5c344429b2429cac8fca8ba706f413b5f0acd1c84f38288bbdc01e5f", "ja": "この長所を伸ばす方法を、考えていました。\n……もっともっと、気にさせたいな。", "zh": "我在思考能发挥这项长处的方法。\n……我想要加倍引人注意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b6f0bdad8ccc180f84778e51a3864591b64b826a836341b273e36e0150993dc4", "ja": "なるほど、それはいいかもしれない。\n何か、いいアイディアでも浮かんだのか？", "zh": "原来如此，听起来好像不错。\n你有想到什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "da264891b3ae81d0100618286a186a84704314804b1d8e2de6581c9464a14336", "ja": "3人でお面を被るというのは、どうでしょう。\n……表情が見えないので、とても気になるかと。", "zh": "你觉得三个人一起戴上面具怎么样？\n……看不见表情，应该会让人非常在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0f8cd313087f7337d71db82f74d32b520fad6e0794fcc89772b4d92f0abf3ee5", "ja": "いや、確かに気にはなるけど、やめよう。\nファンのみんなは、瑞希達の顔が見たいわけだし……。", "zh": "呃，确实是会很在意，但还是别这么做吧。\n毕竟粉丝们就是想看到瑞希你们的脸啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "ebaf8ccc3f8f4fd8455f5ec1cd2f5fe993d9c3c6cd943e7ea1fea36e6bfcc339", "ja": "なるほど、顔が見たい……\nでは、完全に見えない方向はNGで。", "zh": "原来如此，想要看到脸……\n那完全看不见的做法就不OK了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "a34bebe9bd88c623087c171169df3d98e2a3cf218060413361909a07f14974f8", "ja": "なら折衷案で、仮面を被るというのはどうでしょう。\n仮面舞踏会。……なんだかドキドキします。", "zh": "既然如此就折衷，戴半脸面具怎么样？\n化装舞会……听起来让人有种怦然心动的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1011_p", "source_sha256": "928be3df19e71cf916bfcd46163595cb9148769734f548fe17c62381a68cb21b", "ja": "うん、それもまぁ企画としては面白いけど……\nEScapeはもっと、自然体でいいと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "嗯，以企划来说是很有趣啦……\n但我觉得『EScape』只要继续保持最平常的一面就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1012_p", "source_sha256": "44c60fbea0b9d511d944875ec5b7944207371531b1070b50476bbc56e6f39fc8", "ja": "俺も今、瑞希の事が気になって声を掛けたんだし。\nそのままでも、十分気になる存在だと思うよ。", "zh": "我刚才也是因为在意瑞希才过来找你说话。\n我觉得你保持原样，就已经很能引人注意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "9c273cbe797c8d7aaadc58d30c3a1a8f3f43069b3d8b0c0d70a5abc50156b92e", "ja": "おお……。たしかに{$P$}は、\nいつも私のことを気にしてくれています。", "zh": "哦哦……{$P$}，\n你确实总是关注着我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "b89b68d11088c1be97cb3f3e987842a6acd954123e3b3b6d9e94766f368ee5e7", "ja": "ありがとうございます。おかげで、迷いが晴れました。\nいつもどおりの私で、頑張ろうと思います。", "zh": "谢谢你。多亏有你，我摆脱迷惘了。\n我会保持平时的自己，努力加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "6494894ad17624850875ee430f5da77240e96c71bb3e68c263c3e3471cc35144", "ja": "いつもどおり……まずは、軽く手品など。\nでは。", "zh": "跟平时一样……就先来变个魔术之类的吧。\n那我走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0073_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4e2a82d263686efdb99b99092069fd3bf9facff08a049cd03cceb7213f7d2efa", "ja": "ああ、いつもどおりで……って、瑞希！　手品も\nダメだぞ、持ち時間はそんなにないんだからなー！", "zh": "嗯，跟平时一样……不对，瑞希！\n变魔术也不行喔，登台时间没那么充裕啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
